	<Comments><Comment><Identifier>(0x00000030, 0x00000001)</Identifier><Text>Live OpenBCI LSL eye-state detector. Channel 9, 8-12 Hz alpha, 1 second windows every 0.5 seconds. First 20 windows are eyes-open baseline. Closed threshold = +50 percent; open threshold = +30 percent. Closed state requires 6 consecutive windows (about 3 seconds), so blinks remain eyes open. Label_01 = eyes closed, Label_00 = eyes open. Emits initial state once, then only state changes.</Text><Attributes><Attribute><Identifier>(0x473d9a43, 0x97fc0a97)</Identifier><Value>32</Value></Attribute><Attribute><Identifier>(0x7234b86b, 0x2b8651a5)</Identifier><Value>640</Value></Attribute></Attributes></Comment></Comments>
